# Session & auth (CURRENT → TARGET)

- Forms cookie identity name is `logon - server - database` (see `docs/architecture/session-management.md`).
- Tenant SQL connection and lang live in **Profile**, not Session.
- Session holds UI ephemera + warm DataTables (`dc`, rights, reports); InProc by default; Redis provider optional.
- HitsCache (MemoryCache) may hold fat blobs keyed by SessionID when MemoryCacheKeys bits are set.
- TARGET: opaque subject + server-side tenant resolve; no raw ConnectionString in browser-facing profile; don't share InProc Session across strangler iframe and new Razor host.
